15.5  When this Agreement ends, unpaid amounts become due immediately, and each Site is cancelled under
Section 11 at the end of the then-current paid month or the end of any notice period, whichever is later. Sections
6, 7.1, 10, 11.3 to 11.10, 13, 14, and 16 continue to apply.
16. General terms
16.1  The parties are independent contractors. This Agreement does not create a partnership, agency, or
employment relationship.
16.2  Arizona law governs this Agreement, without regard to its conflict-of-law rules. Before filing a lawsuit, the
parties will try in good faith to resolve a dispute for 30 days after written notice. Any lawsuit must be brought in the
courts of Yavapai County, Arizona.
16.3  Partner may not assign this Agreement without Ghostwright's written consent. Ghostwright may assign it, on
notice, to a business entity it owns or controls (such as an LLC) or to a successor to its business.
16.4  Notices must be in writing and sent by email to the addresses in Exhibit B. They take effect on the next
Business Day.
16.5  Changes to this Agreement must be in writing and agreed by both parties, except fee changes under
Section 6.9.
16.6  This Agreement, including its exhibits and the completed Launch Checklist, is the parties' entire agreement
on its subject and replaces earlier discussions. The Terms of Use on Ghostwright's websites apply to use of those
websites. If they conflict with this Agreement, this Agreement controls.
16.7  If part of this Agreement is unenforceable, the rest stays in effect. A delay in enforcing a right is not a waiver.
Neither party is liable for delays caused by events beyond its reasonable control, other than payment. Partner
may sign by hand or electronically.
16.8  Signing and acceptance.
emails the signed copy to Ghostwright. Ghostwright does not sign. Ghostwright accepts by confirming receipt in
writing, and the Agreement takes effect on the date of that confirmation. Ghostwright will not set up an Intake
subdomain for a Partner, or accept an Intake from it, before then. If Partner changes any text before signing, the
